{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_title", "source_sha256": "23068b8c3c3874e65548c226571bd350eb998854f225ce899bce2bac28854373", "ja": "虹の辿り着く先", "zh": "彩虹到达的终点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d8f8ad45437a7832faaa5cf494711f363b0aba3ba22482625f76e102ff62ab6e", "ja": "静香と翼のケンカを見た環は、雨模様の空と\n呼応するように泣き出してしまう。幼い頃の\n記憶から、友達がとても大切な環。仲直りの\n後、環達は百合子のアイディアで、雨上がり\nの空に笑顔の虹を作る。", "zh": "看到静香和翼吵架的环，仿佛在呼应阴雨绵绵的天空般哭了起来。因小时候的记忆，朋友对环而言非常重要。和好之后，环等人在百合子的提议下，于雨后的天空中架起了一道笑容的彩虹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4392b8a632333d9b16f9595f03a72a27fd2596659224a0482f04f8c5181c0d09", "ja": "（ミーティングを明日に延期したので、\nひとまず環を事務室に連れてきた）", "zh": "（因为把会议延期到明天了，先把环带到了办公室）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f81994647e750e9afe468302edfb81a76fc3f506c22398c394bfe37f6c606ba3", "ja": "（のり子と百合子によれば、外の雨模様に\nつられるように、環も泣き出してしまったらしい）", "zh": "（据诺莉子和百合子说，环似乎也被外面的雨势感染，哭了起来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1002_p", "source_sha256": "26b04ec5cb0ac32d213ea068682f603a925b3d9c4aeec307a284e28abbbf8bb8", "ja": "環、大丈夫か？\n落ち着くまで、ここにいていいからな。", "zh": "环，没事吧？\n在你平静下来之前，待在这里就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "dacfd657d033d49741c6e21e47f6539425cf86ec9ad20af7c08e34a6e9ce37ad", "ja": "うん……ごめんなさい、おやぶん……。\nたまき、泣いちゃって……。", "zh": "嗯……对不起，老大……  \n环、忍不住哭了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ce21f95c30f957f2b3695e543004ad5d3c35ff4a2882fa960f37265c5c9b3f32", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。静香と翼がケンカしてるの見て、\n心配になっちゃったのか？", "zh": "没事的。是看到静香和翼在吵架，\n所以觉得担心了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "e13dea35dd8a2e0cd9e65e43fefa99883bee5004f12ad52c5c52e6e810f5014e", "ja": "うん……。\nあのね、おやぶん。たまきね……。", "zh": "嗯……那个，老大。环啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "50a98e435e04a3ebbabb421287e1e84497273f7fc2ca943392f7e185aa726548", "ja": "たまき、小さいころからずっと、\nばあちゃんの家にいたんだけど……。", "zh": "我从小到大一直都住在奶奶家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "90fca49b95bf855c48aa6e6ed4d98fcb01ea27f80e64067badbc3bd871e26dba", "ja": "もっと小さいころは、外国にいたんだ。\nお父さんの、お仕事の都合で……。", "zh": "更小的时候，我还住在国外。\n因为爸爸工作的缘故……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "9cdc6503a558a94130e283240d8d0d007af1396e0dfe20759a7bd791c426e089", "ja": "でも、たまきのことが心配だからって……\nばあちゃんの家に預けられたんだよ。", "zh": "但是，因为担心环……所以就把环寄放在奶奶家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9b7c0f4f9bd29dd1065f05ea37acd006fbedf724f5027ad2dd41fd366c7d6a82", "ja": "そうか……環は、そのおばあさんの家で\n最近まで育ったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……环就是在那位老奶奶家里，一直生活到最近的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "006595759d4ca0406dadb482f5ee927559da31f267348b43a94ba4e65a1063e6", "ja": "うん。お父さんもお母さんも、\nお休みの時は帰ってきてくれたけど……。", "zh": "嗯。虽然爸爸和妈妈在\n放假的时候都会回来看我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "2a3a3ead5df8c43369ab80765abfa79b456163c5385731c431bae522615bfb69", "ja": "でも、ばあちゃんちの近くには、\nたまきくらいの子がいなかったから。", "zh": "可是，奶奶家附近没有和环一样大的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "ada92ec70bcf339c969b68bd08085a26bad3ba99b9225fa35cb0da0a4e3ce246", "ja": "たまき、ずーっと友達がほしかったんだ。", "zh": "环，想要朋友已经很久了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dd96d51daa29345edea50ffdb3316280ff3662da542b2e4bdc7f58012ee2baf8", "ja": "アイドルになるって決めた時も、そう言ってたな。\n友達が100人ほしいって。", "zh": "决定要成为偶像的时候，你也是这么说的。想要有100个朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "790ef9ba64c28b8b65f3d9d5b5726539a614e46cead8108f41c8d2b7fa081784", "ja": "うん！　だから、誰かがケンカしてるの見ると、\nすっごく悲しくなる……。", "zh": "嗯！所以每当看到有人在吵架，就会觉得特别难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6cc00b8ff5758a86e378f8c9f9d7a504231cd0653dadc6d17d94a93002b968ee", "ja": "（そうか……環はケンカに慣れてないから、\n人のケンカが怖いのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（原来如此……环不习惯争吵，所以可能会害怕别人吵架吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a48c6383269e3f97e6249947505ec16a9194005ab1b3bd980e2199beb3cd0a88", "ja": "あまり悲しまなくて大丈夫だよ、環。\n翼と静香も、何か理由があったんだろうし……。", "zh": "不用太难过的，环。\n翼和静香肯定也是有什么原因的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1018_p", "source_sha256": "289f8da54f20b5a0a1dee95027b7011067357fb5aadc6a381f8a1a7461700a08", "ja": "ケンカしたからって、\n二度と仲直りできないような、そんな事はないはずだ。", "zh": "就算吵过架，也不至于再也无法和好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1020_p", "source_sha256": "04a20b846f3ab96010008368dfe614fcdb431b9f3872c6294d173ad4b4152a06", "ja": "（環、まだ納得できてないみたいだな。\n理屈じゃなく気持ちだから、仕方がないけど……）", "zh": "（环好像还没法接受啊。\n毕竟这是感情上的事，不是讲道理就能解决的，没办法……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1021_null", "source_sha256": "ade02e4c64c2d4b391c9f976cad378973fa112398de64d77e61cd18f8c7edca7", "ja": "その頃……", "zh": "与此同时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "d504172d7235c634312e8656fe95c2be95723c07209d4c51e762d939b9da7f33", "ja": "環、大丈夫かしら？\n泣き止んではくれたけど……。", "zh": "小环，没事吧？\n虽然她已经不哭了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7d6b3b5ffce9eed66c97d642ee6ba4f2e24db6994fefb31c843465635d9f6f8c", "ja": "わたし、環みたいな小さい子に泣かれると、\nどうしていいかわからなくて困っちゃうよ～。", "zh": "要是像小环这样的年幼孩子在我面前哭，我就不知道该怎么办了，好困扰啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "e15f76fbe9eb2a502b95b4bba7d2bd0d49bca525046a8e70a1452a0b40c47c85", "ja": "というか、ふたりとも\n何をそんなに言い合ってたの？", "zh": "话说回来，你们俩刚才到底在争论什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1026_null", "source_sha256": "e6eac250efd8315196e3e88187446ea5acd9f0d1c0e91711fd78370cce5043a8", "ja": "1時間ほど前……", "zh": "大约1小时前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "07635d26e06b2a4cb8a2dd3b6c63964e4a02334c64d0154961ca6b8698896771", "ja": "ねえねえ、静香ちゃん。\n次の定期公演のセトリなんだけど！", "zh": "呐呐，静香。\n关于下次定期公演的演出曲目顺序！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e63daa8aca6b314f9848985b5ba1cd4fa6a8d6edfecb9419807b129698a96e61", "ja": "この曲の後って、環のソロでしょ？　\nだったら、こっちと入れ替えたほうがよくない？", "zh": "这首歌之后是环的独唱，对吧？  \n既然这样，和这首对调一下不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "e1f259fdf157bfbb197973b08a8c9ea7086d1da04bdbabf3a679a212767a82c1", "ja": "え？　でもそこを入れ替えると、前半がダンサブルに\nなって……ついていけない人も出てくるんじゃない？", "zh": "诶？可是如果把那部分调换一下，前半就会变得更适合跳舞……会不会有人跟不上啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8f323d55f9b111859909fce1d0a3c0a183773290d86f701c2dca435648e29fd6", "ja": "でも、絶対こっちのほうがいいと思うな～。\nレッスンだってこれからだし、きっと大丈夫だよ♪", "zh": "不过，我觉得绝对还是这边更好～。\n反正接下来还有练习，一定没问题的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fc12685c9171459c12b1cd7265798588888d31c0fab65ba6611b9236e29e46ed", "ja": "もしかして……静香ちゃん、自分が\nついていけないって思ってるんじゃないの～？", "zh": "难道……静香，你是不是觉得自己跟不上了呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d78578016ae78ed4ed0f4605a35101729a0fe269daff8053418a6aede0d5137", "ja": "そ、そんなことないわよ！　私は全体のことを\n考えてるの！　翼みたいに自分勝手じゃないから！", "zh": "才、才没有那回事！我是在考虑全局！我可不像翼那样只顾自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "eaca18e7edc1e589407163e90730116403a51d0490b6325bed99da74b943b083", "ja": "む～！", "zh": "唔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "eaca18e7edc1e589407163e90730116403a51d0490b6325bed99da74b943b083", "ja": "む～！", "zh": "唔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
