{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1076_040tam", "source_sha256": "3a654249c2cd5f000b8948cd88a077885cb1117c9d62a387b6439b7834a57cdc", "ja": "ううん！\n……たまきも、泣いちゃってごめんね？", "zh": "不是的！\n……环也哭了，对不起哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1077_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e7ea33c1f7961acf9d7efd0c88e256355884e53f2e7a02f50a8c17a4a185674a", "ja": "環！　わたしと静香ちゃんに、定期公演のアイディアが\nあるんだ～。明日から、いっしょにレッスンしよ！", "zh": "环！我和静香有个定期公演的点子～从明天开始，一起练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1078_040tam", "source_sha256": "3418671b92d349c83e78ea808aba6cc890df7b9e11a31c991570631539aea939", "ja": "つばさ……うんっ！", "zh": "翼……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1079_p", "source_sha256": "ee4577e9be84c88513f60200b5db836bce78dd360c85f2cb79587001c8ebd8cf", "ja": "環、良かったな。", "zh": "小环，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1080_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1081_043nor", "source_sha256": "7ccfddae9dbba8b64fb359465466cd36b3761c44411f94a7980b962aef91683d", "ja": "ねえねえ、百合子！\nそれ、アタシにもやらせて！", "zh": "呐呐，百合子！\n那个也让我来做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
