{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_098_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_098_1084_040tam", "source_sha256": "e84676e0564367a000bd838cebf2c3effeb808294ca72cc07403fe9d33d3a684", "ja": "たまき！\nたまきが一番、大きな虹を作るぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "环！\n环要做出最大的彩虹～！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
